#: processes/staging-render-log.bpmn:64
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "BEFORE the removal, not after: a job that dies mid-step must leave a record of the intent rather than an artefact that vanished with no entry. A reason is REQUIRED — an entry saying an artefact went and not why is the ambiguity this log exists to prevent."
msgstr ""

#: processes/staging-render-log.bpmn:17
